  "details": "An audio source with looping audio that is enabled/play on awake at start will have a falloff curve that does not match the Unity settings.  In the example scene, ONSP is present but disabled.  Both spheres have identical audio sources with short custom falloff in the Unity audio source curve.  The rainbow source is enabled at start, and has a very long range until toggled off and on.\n\nWorld id: wrld_88be5c93-d1c5-4966-80f3-bd169ee75979",
